  ObjectName: Neptune
  Facts:
  - text: "Neptune is the farthest planet from the Sun \u2014 it\u2019s the 8th planet
      in our solar system!"
  - text: "It\u2019s super windy \u2014 Neptune has the strongest winds in the whole
      solar system, blowing faster than 1,200 mph (2,000 km/h)!"
  - text: "It\u2019s a gas giant \u2014 made mostly of gases like hydrogen and helium,
      with a deep blue color."
  - text: "It has a giant storm called the Great Dark Spot, kind of like Jupiter\u2019s
      storm but darker and smaller"
  - text: "Neptune has 14 moons \u2014 the biggest one is Triton, which spins the
      opposite way of Neptune\u2019s rotation!"
  SceneName: NeptuneScene
